# OneDrive Java SDK - Build OneDrive Integrations - Apideck
created: undefined, last updated: 2026-06-12, [Read more](https://www.apideck.com/integrations/onedrive/sdk/java)

Build OneDrive integrations in Javawith Apideck's official SDK.
...
```
import com.apideck.Apideck;
import com.apideck.models.*;
public class OneDriveIntegration {
public static void main(String[] args) {
Apideck apideck = Apideck.builder()
.apiKey(System.getenv("APIDECK_API_KEY"))
.appId(System.getenv("APIDECK_APP_ID"))
.consumerId("user-123")
.build();
// Connect to OneDrive
var connections = apideck.file-storage().connectionsAll()
.serviceId("onedrive")
.execute();
// List data from OneDrive
var companies = apideck.file-storage().companiesAll()
.serviceId("onedrive")
.execute();
System.out.println(companies);
}
}
```
